ght":440.0,"title":"COMMENT","connected":false,"org_parent_x":-1.0,"org_parent_y":-1.0,"has_org_parent":false,"code":[["Comment","Memory map (VIC bank 1, $DD00=$3E, $01=$05 - no ROMs):\n$0400-$2892 screen-shift speedcode (built at boot by $861F)\n$2899 screen row table  $2980-$4CFF road segments 0-15\n$4D00-$53FF game variables  $6540-$657F blank sprite ($95, HUD)  $6770 blank road row  $F800-$F9F7 spare segments + course tables (SH_ROAD)\n$5400-$653F sprites  $6400 HUD screen (bottom rows)\n$6800 font \/ HUD charset  $7000 road charset\n$7800 \/ $7C00 playfield screens (double buffered)  $8000-$BFFF cartridge code + tables (boot generators and their packed source data left out - 5.3K free in there)\n$C000-$CFFF road segments 16-21 (moved from $E800 - pointers at $AD73)\n$E000 music + sound mix + SID SONG player (SH_MUSIC)  $FF00-$FF5A music zero-page saves  $FFFA vectors"]],"binary_blob":""},{"x":160.0,"y":0.0,"type":"COMMENT","custom_title":"","stable_uid":100001.0,"wire_in_source":-1.0,"wire_out_target":-1.0,"org_uid":-1.0,"show_only_used":false,"code_descriptor":"Code Block","scroll_alias":"","anim_alias":"","helper_text":"","comment_w_mult":1.0,"x_indent":0.0,"proxy":true,"collapsed":false,"end_address":0.0,"pc_address":0.0,"height":800.0,"title":"COMMENT","connected":false,"org_parent_x":-1.0,"org_parent_y":-1.0,"has_org_parent":false,"code":[["Comment","SPY HUNTER (Sega \/ Bally Midway 1984 cartridge) - full port of the 16K cart image from 'Spy Hunter.d64'.\nSpine: INIT -> START GAME. All assets are in the program image.\nMusic: one Music Maker song SH_MUSIC (SID SONG node, VOICE LOCK on), ORG $E000;\nthe cartridge driver still plays the sound effects. Assets are grouped GRAPHICS \/ ROAD \/ MUSIC.\nEvery ORG block on the right holds the original cartridge code at its original address ($8000-$BFFF).\nThe cartridge used to build its graphics and road into RAM at power-on; those are now assets at the same\naddresses, so they can be edited: SH_FONT ($6800), SH_ROADCHR ($7000), SH_SPRITES_A ($5400, 64) + SH_SPRITES_B ($6400, 5)\nand the road: META_TILESETs SH_ROAD_A ($2980, segments 0-15) \/ SH_ROAD_B ($C000, 16-21),\none map per segment, RAW ROWS on."]],"binary_blob":""},{"x":860.0,"y":60.0,"type":"INIT","custom_title":"","stable_uid":100004.0,"wire_in_source":-1.0,"wire_out_target":-1.0,"org_uid":-1.0,"show_only_used":false,"code_descriptor":"Code Block","scroll_alias":"","anim_alias":"","helper_text":"","comment_w_mult":1.0,"x_indent":0.0,"proxy":true,"collapsed":false,"end_address":2071.0,"pc_address":2062.0,"height":80.0,"title":"SYSTEM INIT","connected":true,"org_parent_x":-1.0,"org_parent_y":-1.0,"has_org_parent":false,"code":[["sei",0.0],["lda_imm",0.0],["sta_abs",53280.0],["sta_abs",53281.0]],"binary_blob":""},{"x":860.0,"y":140.0,"type":"MACRO_CODE","custom_title":"","stable_uid":100005.0,"wire_in_source":-1.0,"wire_out_target":-1.0,"org_uid":-1.0,"show_only_used":false,"code_descriptor":"START GAME","scroll_alias":"","anim_alias":"","helper_text":"","comment_w_mult":1.0,"x_indent":0.0,"proxy":true,"collapsed":false,"end_address":2084.0,"pc_address":2071.0,"height":100.0,"title":"Code Block","connected":true,"org_parent_x":-1.0,"org_parent_y":-1.0,"has_org_parent":false,"code":[["code_block","; SPY HUNTER - entry. The crack loader did: copy chargen $D000-$D1FF to $E000 (only the old font\n; builder used it), $01=$05, JMP ($8002) = $8027. Every asset below is part of the program image.\n; @asset SH_FONT\n; @asset SH_ROADCHR\n; @asset SH_SPRITES_A\n; @asset SH_SPRITES_B\n    sei\n    lda #$7f\n    sta $dc0d                ; CIA1 ICR - no timer IRQs\n    lda #$05\n    sta $01                  ; RAM everywhere, I\/O in\n    jmp COLD_START              ; cartridge cold start\n"]],"binary_blob":""},{"x":2480.0,"y":160.0,"type":"MACRO_CODE","custom_title":"","stable_uid":100017.0,"wire_in_source":-1.0,"wire_out_target":-1.0,"org_uid":-1.0,"show_only_used":false,"code_descriptor":"GAME LOGIC $8800","scroll_alias":"","anim_